rmalNorth",[]],["EndMovement",[]],["Delay8",[]],["WalkOnSpotNormalSouth",[]],["EndMovement",[]]]},"messages":{"msg_0146_D51R0201_00000":"Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\\nmythical stage built to show respect\\ffor ARCEUS.\\rIt is said that people used to\\ncelebrate its magnificent might with\\fmusic and dance.\\rSome people in Johto still pass down\\nthis tradition.\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00001":"Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}. The\\nmythical stage built to show respect\\ffor ARCEUS.\\rIt is said that people used to\\ncelebrate its magnificent might with\\fmusic and dance.\\rSome people in Johto still pass down\\nthis tradition.","msg_0146_D51R0201_00002":"Cynthia: The {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0} allows a\\nsingle ARCEUS and nothing else to\\fget on the stage...\\rIf you wish to go up there, you have\\nto deposit your other Pokémon in\\fa PC Box at the cabin.","msg_0146_D51R0201_00003":"Cynthia: Bring your ARCEUS instead.\\rAny other Pokémon may get blown away\\nby the strong power lingering\\fat the ruins.\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00004":"Cynthia: This is where one might say,\\n“The lead enters the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}\\fat last.”\\rAll my study of ruins and Pokémon\\nmythology in Sinnoh may have been\\fto bring you up on this stage\\fhere today...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00005":"Cynthia: Depicted on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}\\nare the Pokémon that shaped\\fthis world.\\rThe circle in the middle is ARCEUS,\\nthe origin of it all...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00006":"Cynthia: According to an ancient\\ndocument, time, space, and antimatter,\\for what combined we call the world,\\fshall be born when ARCEUS stands\\fon the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00007":"Cynthia: This is the pattern that\\nrepresents PALKIA, the master of\\fspace and dimensions...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00008":"Cynthia: This is the pattern that\\nrepresents DIALGA, the guardian\\fof time...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00009":"Cynthia: This is the pattern that\\nrepresents GIRATINA, the ruler of\\fthe world that is on the opposite side\\fof ours, the world of antimatter...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00010":"Cynthia: ARCEUS has accepted you as\\na Trainer.\\rARCEUS, having shaped the world,\\nis said to show you a glimpse of\\fits true power.\\rThe power of possibly making life\\nappear out of nothing...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00011":"Cynthia: It seems that something\\nwill happen when you choose one\\fof the circles...\\rYou’ll want to be well prepared.","msg_0146_D51R0201_00012":"Cynthia: Once you are ready, choose a\\ncircle and stand in the middle of it.","msg_0146_D51R0201_00013":"Cynthia: So you choose DIALGA,\\nthe guardian of time? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00014":"Cynthia: So you choose PALKIA, the\\nmaster of space and dimensions? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00015":"Cynthia: So you choose GIRATINA,\\nthe ruler of the Distortion World? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00016":"Cynthia: That shining sphere...\\nCould it be...an Egg?\\rDid we just witness the very moment\\nan Egg was brought to this world?\\fA moment no one has ever seen?\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00017":"Cynthia: An Egg is the cradle of every\\nbeing. This planet itself is an Egg\\fin a sense...\\rLife that comes from an Egg will\\ncome to an end in due course...\\fto begin anew...\\rThat may be what ARCEUS\\nwanted to show us.\\r\\n","msg_0146_D51R0201_00018":"Cynthia: That was...?\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00019":"Cynthia: We seem to be surrounded by\\nthat strong power again...!\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00020":"Cynthia: Of course... ARCEUS!\\rSo the source of the power I’ve felt\\nwas ARCEUS!\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00021":"Cynthia: What is now the {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins\\n{COLOR 0}was built to honor ARCEUS by the\\fSinnoh people...\\rIt’s an icebound temple that has been\\nwaiting for ARCEUS for hundreds\\fof years...\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00022":"Cynthia: This is the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}.\\rIt is designed to bring out the power\\nARCEUS possesses.\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00023":"Cynthia: ARCEUS is described in\\nmythology as being the origin of\\feverything and the source of\\fall beings.\\rIt is said that the power of ARCEUS\\nis released on the {COLOR 1}Mystri Stage{COLOR 0}!\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00024":"Cynthia: The {COLOR 1}Sinjoh Ruins{COLOR 0} are what\\nremains of a temple built to show\\frespect for ARCEUS.","msg_0146_D51R0201_00025":"The mysterious round object\\ntook the shape of a Pokémon!\\r","msg_0146_D51R0201_00026":"{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} obtained\\nthe {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}!","msg_0146_D51R0201_00027":"Will you choose DIALGA? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00028":"Will you choose PALKIA? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00029":"Will you choose GIRATINA? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00030":"This place does not seem to respond...","msg_0146_D51R0201_00031":"It seems that only a single ARCEUS\\ncan stand here...","msg_0146_D51R0201_00032":"Would you like to give a nickname\\nto the {STRVAR_1 0, 1, 0}? {YESNO 0}","msg_0146_D51R0201_00033":"It seems it no longer responds\\nto this ARCEUS..."},"initTriggers":[{"var":"VAR_SCENE_SINJOH_MYSTRI_ROOM","value":3,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_006 + 1"},{"var":"VAR_SCENE_SINJOH_MYSTRI_ROOM","value":12,"script":"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_007 + 1"}],"initScripts":{"OnTransition":"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_002 + 1"},"constants":{"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_000":0,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_001":1,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_002":2,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_003":3,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_004":4,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_005":5,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_006":6,"_EV_scr_seq_D51R0201_007":7,"obj_D51R0201_champion":0}}
